      "content": "i know i should reach out, but what's the point? everyone just tells me things will get better, but they don't get it. it's not just being sad. it's like the light has been permanently turned off. i just feel so much more connected to him when i think about being where he is right now... peaceful. away from all this noise and hurting. it almost feels like the only way to actually be with him again.",
